<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Valassis.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co raised its rating on Valassis Communications Inc to buy from outperform, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
